s":"paired","id":"texts:131111"},{"key":"MINING_BASE_PROJECT_DESC","zh":"成立一个科学部门来远程研究最新发现的古代无人机处理中心。","en":"Task a science department with remotely studying the last known Ancient Mining Drone Processing Hub.","source":"projects_2","category":"科技与发展","namespace":"gameplay","es":"localisation/english/projects_2_l_english.yml","el":25,"zs":"localisation/simp_chinese/projects_2_l_simp_chinese.yml","zl":17,"status":"paired","id":"texts:131112"},{"key":"DEAL_WITH_FLORA","zh":"植物的入侵","en":"Plant Aggression","source":"projects_2","category":"科技与发展","namespace":"gameplay","es":"localisation/english/projects_2_l_english.yml","el":29,"zs":"localisation/simp_chinese/projects_2_l_simp_chinese.yml","zl":19,"status":"paired","id":"texts:131113"},{"key":"DEAL_WITH_FLORA_DESC","zh":"这个星球上的植物群非常地灵巧，惊人地具有侵略性，绝对值得近距离研究。","en":"The planet's flora is remarkably dexterous, alarmingly aggressive, and definitely worthy of closer study.","source":"projects_2","category":"科技与发展","namespace":"gameplay","es":"localisation/english/projects_2_l_english.yml","el":30,"zs":"localisation/simp_chinese/projects_2_l_simp_chinese.yml","zl":20,"status":"paired","id":"texts:131114"},{"key":"OLD_GODS_BENEFACTRESS_PROJECT","zh":"古神：恩赐女神","en":"Old Gods: The Benefactress","source":"projects_2","category":"科技与发展","namespace":"gameplay","es":"localisation/english/projects_2_l_english.yml","el":32,"zs":"localisation/simp_chinese/projects_2_l_simp_chinese.yml","zl":21,"status":"paired","id":"texts:131115"},{"key":"OLD_GODS_BENEFACTRESS_PROJECT_DESC","zh":"恩赐女神神龛的每一面上都覆盖着由的象形文字组成的复杂网络，似乎在诉说着一个远比[Root.Owner.Capital.GetName]的上古传说更加恢弘的故事。\\n\\n即使只是与已知的古[Root.Owner.GetSpeciesName]语言有着些许的关系，只要有足够的时间和资源，在当代科技的帮助下，我们也可以解读这些象形文字。","en":"Every surface of the Benefactress' shrine is covered with a complex web of pictograms, seemingly telling a story far more expansive than the lingering fables on [Root.Owner.Capital.GetName].\\n\\nThough only distantly related to known ancient [Root.Owner.GetSpeciesName] languages: modern technology should allow us to decipher the pictograms, given enough time and resources.","source":"projects_2","category":"科技与发展","namespace":"gameplay","es":"localisation/english/projects_2_l_english.yml","el":33,"zs":"localisation/simp_chinese/projects_2_l_simp_chinese.yml","zl":22,"status":"paired","id":"texts:131116"},{"key":"OLD_GODS_UNDAUNTED_PROJECT","zh":"古神：勇气之神","en":"Old Gods: The Undaunted","source":"projects_2","category":"科技与发展","namespace":"gameplay","es":"localisation/english/projects_2_l_english.yml","el":34,"zs":"localisation/simp_chinese/projects_2_l_simp_chinese.yml","zl":23,"status":"paired","id":"texts:131117"},{"key":"OLD_GODS_UNDAUNTED_PROJECT_DESC","zh":"一如萦绕着祂的神话传说，供奉勇气之神神龛的神庙充满了无法确定来源与作用的装置。与简单的谜箱相去甚远，位于[Root.Owner.Capital.GetName]的祂的神庙中四处充满着对力量的试炼，传说只有真正的贤者才读到祂的圣言。\\n\\n我们先进的分析工具应该可以迅速破解这些密码。","en":"The temple holding the Undaunted's shrine is - true to the myths surrounding him - filled with contraptions of indeterminate origin and purpose. A far cry from the simple puzzle-boxes and tests of strength that once filled his temples on [Root.Owner.Capital.GetName], it was once claimed that his holy texts could only be read by the truly worthy.\\n\\nOur sophisticated analysis tools should make short work of these ciphers.","source":"projects_2","category":"科技与发展","namespace":"gameplay","es":"localisation/english/projects_2_l_english.yml","el":35,"zs":"localisation/simp_chinese/projects_2_l_simp_chinese.yml","zl":24,"status":"paired","id":"texts:131118"},{"key":"OLD_GODS_PERCIPIENT_PROJECT","zh":"古神：洞察女神","en":"Old Gods: The Percipient","source":"projects_2","category":"科技与发展","namespace":"gameplay","es":"localisation/english/projects_2_l_english.yml","el":36,"zs":"localisation/simp_chinese/projects_2_l_simp_chinese.yml","zl":25,"status":"paired","id":"texts:131119"},{"key":"OLD_GODS_PERCIPIENT_PROJECT_DESC","zh":"放置着洞察女神神像的洞室，其外墙被一层层厚重的金属漆所覆盖，但神像本身却是光秃秃的。\\n\\n洞察女神的传说只会告诉那些能够理解这些传说的人——只有足够敏锐的人才能分辨哪些东西是真正需要领会的。","en":"The walls housing this shrine to the Percipient are coated with thick layers of a mineral-based lacquer, but the shrine itself is bare.\\n\\nThe tales of the Percipient are told only to those perceptive enough to understand their meaning - it is just a matter of figuring out what needs to be perceived.","source":"projects_2","category":"科技与发展","namespace":"gameplay","es":"localisation/english/projects_2_l_english.yml","el":37,"zs":"localisation/simp_chinese/projects_2_l_simp_chinese.yml","zl":26,"status":"paired","id":"texts:131120"},{"key":"LIMBO_1_PROJECT","zh":"生死弥留","en":"In Limbo","source":"projects_2","category":"科技与发展","namespace":"gameplay","es":"localisation/english/projects_2_l_english.yml","el":39,"zs":"localisation/simp_chinese/projects_2_l_simp_chinese.yml","zl":27,"status":"paired","id":"texts:131121"},{"key":"LIMBO_1_PROJECT_DESC","zh":"一个满载着各种数据存储设备的外星避难所，亟待考古学家恢复数据。","en":"An alien vault filled with data storage devices practically begs for some archaeological data recovery.","source":"projects_2","category":"科技与发展","namespace":"gameplay","es":"localisation/english/projects_2_l_english.yml","el":40,"zs":"localisation/simp_chinese/projects_2_l_simp_chinese.yml","zl":28,"status":"paired","id":"texts:131122"},{"key":"PROJECTING_MOON_PROJECT","zh":"奇异无比","en":"Projecting","source":"projects_2","category":"科技与发展","namespace":"gameplay","es":"localisation/english/projects_2_l_english.yml","el":42,"zs":"localisation/simp_chinese/projects_2_l_simp_chinese.yml","zl":29,"status":"paired","id":"texts:131123"},{"key":"PROJECTING_MOON_PROJECT_DESC","zh":"一颗异常的行星和它异常的卫星；常规的技术无法给出满意的探测结果，需要进行更加实地的调查。","en":"An unusual planet has an unusual moon; the usual scanning techniques do not give satisfactory results, and a more hands-on approach is needed.","source":"projects_2","category":"科技与发展","namespace":"gameplay","es":"localisation/english/projects_2_l_english.yml","el":43,"zs":"localisation/simp_chinese/projects_2_l_simp_chinese.yml","zl":30,"status":"paired","id":"texts:131124"},{"key":"